## Arquitetura (resumo)

```
[Next.js RSC / actions]
  |-- apiServer("/custom-fields?entity=CONTACT|DEAL")
  |-- apiServer("PATCH /contacts/:id/custom-data", { values })
  |-- apiServer("PATCH /deals/:id/custom-data", { values })
        |
        v
[NestJS + Prisma]
  CustomFieldsController  ---> CustomFieldsService ---> CustomField table
  ContactsController PATCH --> ContactsService ------> merge customData + defs CONTACT
  DealsController PATCH -----> DealsService --------> merge customData + defs DEAL
```

